Speed Dreams v2.4.2, upstream source and its pinned data and FreeSOLID.
Source: https://forge.a-lec.org/speed-dreams/speed-dreams-code

Upstream's README.md specifies GPL-2-or-later as the default code license
and the Free Art License as the default non-functional data license.
Individual directories and assets carry additional notices and licenses.
These notices are retained in the source and installed data.
The complete GPL version 2 text is installed as LICENSE alongside this file
and is available at /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2.

FreeSOLID is by Gino van den Bergen, as its README records, and is
distributed under the GNU Library/Lesser General Public License.
Its full COPYING file is retained in the source.

This file is an initial upstream-based package record for local testing.
The main session must complete the per-asset copyright inventory before
public repository integration.
